Silver Peak MIB updates
======================

Source: user-supplied HPE bundle in mibs-9.7.
Two changed vendor files; SILVERPEAK-SMI and SILVERPEAK-TC are identical.
Bundled standard MIBs are not imported.

Both changed files retain their historical declared revisions. Compare contents
and OID mappings rather than dates when accepting future bundles.

Products: spsEC10150 and spsEC10170 (children 67 and 68).
Management: 42 additional alarm descriptions and six corrected descriptions.
These management changes are DESCRIPTION text, not changed numeric OIDs.

